faq:
  - q: How do we stop two partners claiming the same customer?
    a: Hold any submission that matches an active enquiry, apply the ownership rule, and tell both sides the outcome.
  - q: Should partners see our pricing?
    a: Only if you choose to share it. A separate partner view lets you show leads and status without exposing internal data.
  - q: When should commission be paid?
    a: When the trigger you published is met, such as advance received or project completed. Record the decision so partners can see it.
